<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-16698] IgniteStripedThreadPoolExecutor displays incorrect metrics values.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-16698</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently only &lt;tt&gt;IgniteThreadPoolExecutor&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;StripedPool&lt;/tt&gt; have implement correct thread pool metrics.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;IgniteStripedThreadPoolExecutor&lt;/tt&gt; displays incorrect metrics values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
            mreg.longMetric(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;ActiveCount&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, ACTIVE_COUNT_DESC).value(0);
            mreg.longMetric(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;CompletedTaskCount&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, COMPLETED_TASK_DESC).value(0);
            mreg.longMetric(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;CorePoolSize&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, CORE_SIZE_DESC).value(0);
            mreg.longMetric(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;LargestPoolSize&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, LARGEST_SIZE_DESC).value(0);
            mreg.longMetric(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;MaximumPoolSize&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, MAX_SIZE_DESC).value(0);
            mreg.longMetric(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;PoolSize&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, POOL_SIZE_DESC).value(0);
            mreg.longMetric(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;TaskCount&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, TASK_COUNT_DESC);
            mreg.longMetric(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;QueueSize&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, QUEUE_SIZE_DESC).value(0);
            mreg.longMetric(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;KeepAliveTime&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, KEEP_ALIVE_TIME_DESC).value(0);
...
            mreg.longMetric(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;Terminating&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, IS_TERMINATING_DESC);
            mreg.objectMetric(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;RejectedExecutionHandlerClass&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt;.class, REJ_HND_DESC).value(&quot;&quot;);
            mreg.objectMetric(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;ThreadFactoryClass&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;String&lt;/span&gt;.class, THRD_FACTORY_DESC).value(&quot;&quot;);
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We should implement the correct metrics for this pool similarly to &lt;tt&gt;IgniteThreadPoolExecutor&lt;/tt&gt;, but in an aggregated form. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
